                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}^{p|q}
            is freely generated as a super-
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/module"} module
            over the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+superalgebra"} smooth superalgebra
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi C
                    %mn ∞
