          %p
            This
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/de+Rham+complex"} de Rham complex
            now carries the structure of a
          %ul
            %li differential graded-commutative graded commutative superalgebra
          %p which should be thought of as bracketet as follows
          %ul
            %li differential graded-commutative graded (commutative superalgebra).
          %p
            This means in effect that elements of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
